<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Ostasio III da Polenta</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">died 1447</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Ostasio III da Polenta was the last lord of Ravenna from the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/da-polenta-family">Da Polenta family</a>, which had ruled the city since the late 13th century. Increasingly dependent on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/venice">Venice</a>, he was deposed in 1441 when the Venetians annexed Ravenna, and he was sent into exile on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/crete">Crete</a>, where he died.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/ostasio-iii-da-polenta.jpg" alt="Ostasio III da Polenta" width="320" height="243" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Giuseppe Lorenzo Gatteri and Francesco Zanotto · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:71._Obizzo_da_Polenta_Signor_di_Ravenna_lascia_morendo,_suo_figlio_Ostasio_III_raccomandato_alla_Repubblica_Veneta,_25_Gennaro_anno_1432.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
